# Build output.
#
# The parent checkout builds this package into lib/ and does not track it, and no
# sibling plugin tracks it either: it is generated from src/ by tsc + tsdown, so
# committing it would put 4.8 MB of machine-written JavaScript in the history and
# guarantee conflicts on every rebuild.
lib/

# Workspace links created by pnpm; the real dependencies live in the workspace.
node_modules/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
